+ * device tree). Linux puts the controller in a translated domain; nothing here does, and a doorbell outside UEFI's driver resets the
+ * phone, so: dump the stream matching entries (smmu_dump=1) and, with smmu_bypass=1, make the entries that match the UFS stream IDs
+ * bypass (S2CR type 1) before the TEST UNIT READY.
+ */
+#define SMMU_PA 0x15000000ULL
+static int smmu_dump_requested, smmu_bypass_requested;
