+/*
+ * Image AW (tlmm_test=5): Mu's own protocols instead of raw register writes (found in image AV; layouts from Qualcomm's QcomPkg/Include/Protocol, as
+ * edk2-msm's touch drivers use them). Everything said before it is done; nothing is powered except gpio38 (the touch reset line) set as an output.
